  << /ActualText (At KEA\054 I developed a solid understanding of digital design\054 UX\054 and web development\056 Our work focused on core design principles with a constant priority on the user\056 I applied various testing and research methods to ensure the best possible user experience\056\n\nThe degree provided me with hands\055on experience using tools such as Figma\054 the Adobe Creative Suite\054 HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\054 as well as frameworks like Astro and Tailwind for developing design systems\056 Additionally\054 I have worked on idea development\054 wireframing\054 prototyping\054 user testing\054 and frontend development\024often within interdisciplinary teams and with a focus on iterative processes and user\055centered design\056)
